        <dc:title>Miss Nolly's Class</dc:title>
        <dc:creator opf:file-as="Arlet, Helen" opf:role="aut">Arlet, Helen</dc:creator>
        <dc:contributor opf:file-as="calibre" opf:role="bkp">calibre (3.42.0) [https://calibre-ebook.com]</dc:contributor>
        <dc:date>2017-11-30T00:00:00+00:00</dc:date>
        <dc:description>&lt;p&gt;Miss Nolly is a shark. To be more specific, shi is an aquatic humanoid genetically engineered for underwater construction. Although shi is one of the lucky ones who avoided life in the construction industry by serving for educational purposes. In other words, shi's a college professor. But what should have been a pampered life of teaching marine biology and grading papers isn't turning out to be all it's cracked up to be. Nolly has hir fair share of problems. Life as a hermaphrodite isn't always that easy. Then there are other problems on top of that, like students with a crush on hir, students with an unnatural desire to climb into hir mouth, bothersome coworkers who can't stay out of trouble, a defiant daughter, blackmailers, hir job being in danger, and to top it all off, shi seems to be slowly giving in to the predatory instincts of hir species. Miss Nolly is going to have hir hands full getting all of this sorted out. Or shi could just give in and see what happens...   &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Nolly's Class is a 22,000+ word erotic story packed full of steamy action featuring a sexy shark college professor. Also vore. &lt;br /&gt;
All characters portrayed in sexual acts are clearly stated to be 18 years of age or older. &lt;br /&gt;
Cover art created by Mamabliss.&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
